<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy 2-yr CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy 2-yr CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 2.5 trillion lire auction of a third tranche of January 15, 1999 two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ) and 2.0 trillion lire auction of a third tranche of 18-month July 15, 1998 CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Jul 15, 98  Pvs    Jan 15,'99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 5.47 pct    5.86   5.43 pct    5.25</p>
<p>Gross Yield     6.20 pct    6.59   6.17 pct    5.99</p>
<p>Assigned price 91.85	 91.15   89.15	89.25</p>
<p>Bids	     7.61 trillion lire   8.37 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 2.00 trillion lire   2.50 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with previous auctions of the Jan 15, 1999 and Jul 15 1998 CTZs on January 28.</p>
</text>
